5,mythologies of the Gelao people – World Mythology,https://indigpeople.wordpress.com/2023/04/02/mythologies-of-the-gelao-people/,"The Green Gelao people live in China’s Guizhou Province and in northern Vietnam. The Green Gelao people are primarily ancestor worshipers who also practice traditional religion. They worship the spirit of the rice paddies, the spirit of burn over land, and the spirits that protect their livestock.","Gelao, Green",Kra-Dai
