7,"Gelao, Green",https://docs.verbix.com/Languages/GelaoGreen,"Language: Gelao, Green. Alternate names: Cape Draping Gelao, Hakhi, Hoki Gelao, Klau, Qau. Language code: giq. Language family: Tai-Kadai, Kadaic, Southwestern Kra, Western Kra, Gelaoic, Southwestern Gelao. Number of speakers: 300.","Gelao, Green",Kra-Dai
8,"Appendix:Gelao Swadesh lists - Wiktionary, the free dictionary",https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Appendix:Gelao_Swadesh_lists,"This appendix contains Swadesh lists of words in Gelao language varieties spoken in Vietnam, compared with that of English and Vietnamese. The lists below are from Samarina (2011).[1].","Gelao, Green",Kra-Dai
9,Gelao languages _ AcademiaLab,https://academia-lab.com/enciclopedia/gelao-languages/,"Gelao es un Kra Lengua de la familia de lenguas Kra-Dai. Lo habla el pueblo Gelao en el sur de China y el norte de Vietnam.Sanchong, Longlin, Guangxi. Green Gelao of Hoàng Su Phì, Vietnam. Norte (Gelao Rojo). Qiaoshang, Xiongjiazhai.","Gelao, Green",Kra-Dai
